.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-admin-signing-pin-validity 1  "oct-admin-signing-pin-validity " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-admin\-signing\-pin\-validity \- Configure if user PIN presentation is valid for just one signing operation, or for unlimited signing operations
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct admin signing\-pin\-validity\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISTATE\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Configure if user PIN presentation is valid for just one signing operation, or for unlimited signing operations
.PP
Configure the "only valid for one PSO:CDS" setting in PW Status Bytes.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISTATE\fR>
Validity of user PIN presentation for signing operations
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
once
.IP \(bu 2
unlimited
.RE
